    "raw": "While both the X'i and the Thelusian people refuse to divulge the nature of their 'bond' there is no doubting it is there. Thelusians have been seen to viciously defend X'i (even strangers!) without any real explanation as to why. X'ians, when pressed, have implied in their strange language something akin to 'Star Bretheren'.",
    "value": "尽管艾肯族与蚁族均拒绝透露他们之间“羁绊”的实质，但其存在毋庸置疑。我们曾目睹蚁族拼死捍卫艾肯族人（即便是陌生人！），却无人能解释其缘由。而艾肯族在被追问时，会以其奇特的语言暗示某种类似于“星际同胞”的关系。"
